    (OUT/'VERIFICATION.md').write_text(report,encoding='utf-8');(OUT/'final.md').write_text(final,encoding='utf-8')
    retro="We resumed from complete saved audit records and preserved the earlier endpoints by hash. The coordinator changed four inputs twice, so we froze each structural audit separately and kept the blind observations fixed. The independent count implementation reproduced every site cell for all three recorded states. The second follow-up checks explicit local site labels and baseline identifier columns, and distinguishes applied protocol status from historical context decisions.\n\nThe broader candidate review found named excavation areas that the coordinator's directional-word filter did not distinguish, as well as incompatible materials and object classes. The historical Dholavira grid algorithm still reproduces. Catalogue containment needs a complete excavation-group identity; the earlier requirement for an individual registration was stronger than the protocol requires for containment. Eight catalogue-preface pages were newly OCRed to identity projections, with each render deleted immediately. The contents ranges were recovered, but the site-section premise remains unconfirmed.\n\nWe revisited nine unresolved omission inventories with closed identity terms and separated two-column PDF text through existing coordinate extraction tools. Eight pages could then be assessed; one remains unresolved. No substitution changed the random sample. Composite registration punctuation needed a correction in the unnamed-family search, which added one complete registration occurrence. Numeric windows and bibliographic title citations account for the raw source-window matches.\n\nTwo display filters failed to isolate identity content completely. We recorded their affected pages and tightened the projection; the exposure failure remains part of this run. No source witness, frozen input or list row was edited. No download, installation or page-image view was needed, and no existing complete page text was re-OCRed. The results support reproducible arithmetic for the frozen snapshots; the remaining source and candidate checks are the next evidence needed.\n"
